# =============================================================
# Strong Family Press — .gitignore
# The public repository must contain website files only.
# =============================================================

# --- MANUSCRIPT AND PRIVATE SOURCE MATERIAL -----------------
# Keep every draft and reference document out of the public repo.
# Put them in these folders on your computer and they can never be
# committed by accident.
Manuscript/
Private/
Reference/
Drafts/

# Manuscript files by name, in case they are ever saved loose
7_Steps_Final.pdf
7 Steps Final.pdf
*Final.docx
*manuscript*
*Manuscript*

# --- DOCUMENTS ----------------------------------------------
# NOTE: *.pdf is deliberately NOT ignored. A sample chapter, a media
# kit, or the lead magnet may need to be published from
# Assets/downloads/. Word files are never published, so they are.
*.docx
*.doc
*.pages

# --- CREDENTIALS AND CONFIGURATION --------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets.*

# --- BUSINESS AND PERSONAL RECORDS --------------------------
Contracts/
Financial/
Contacts/
*.csv

# --- OPERATING SYSTEM AND EDITOR ----------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- LOCAL BUILD OR PREVIEW ARTIFACTS -----------------------
node_modules/
.cache/
